@startuml
title Defense Core — System Context and Use Cases
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Workflow operator" as Operator
actor "Academic evaluator" as Evaluator

rectangle "Defense-core workflow application\n(single system boundary)" {
  usecase "Define or select\nworkflow" as UC_Definition
  usecase "Validate definition\nbefore run creation" as UC_Validate
  usecase "Select execution mode\nand named scenario" as UC_Select
  usecase "Start isolated run" as UC_Start
  usecase "Inspect persistent\nordered trace" as UC_Trace
  usecase "Compare orchestration\nand choreography" as UC_Compare
}

Operator --> UC_Definition
Operator --> UC_Select
Operator --> UC_Start
Operator --> UC_Trace
Evaluator --> UC_Trace
Evaluator --> UC_Compare

UC_Definition ..> UC_Validate : <<include>>
UC_Start ..> UC_Validate : <<include>>
UC_Start ..> UC_Select : <<include>>
UC_Compare ..> UC_Trace : <<include>>

note right of UC_Validate
Invalid definition:
no run or execution state is created.
end note

note bottom of UC_Select
Modes: orchestration or choreography.
Scenarios: success, retry-then-success,
or permanent failure.
Specification only; not executed or passed.
end note

